WEBVTT

00:00.056 --> 00:00.912
Ito ay baryo.

00:01.112 --> 00:01.609
At ito naman

00:01.609 --> 00:02.303
ay barangay.

00:02.503 --> 00:02.873
Ano nga ba

00:02.873 --> 00:03.440
ang pinagkaiba

00:03.440 --> 00:03.845
nila?

00:04.045 --> 00:04.508
Si lolo at

00:04.508 --> 00:04.924
lola,

00:04.924 --> 00:05.873
baryo ang tawag.

00:06.073 --> 00:06.466
Pero sa ID

00:06.466 --> 00:06.756
mo,

00:06.756 --> 00:07.230
barangay ang

00:07.230 --> 00:07.936
nakasulat.

00:08.136 --> 00:08.773
Magkaiba ba talaga

00:08.773 --> 00:09.212
sila?

00:09.411 --> 00:09.966
Ang sagot:

00:09.966 --> 00:10.811
iisa lang sila!

00:11.011 --> 00:11.694
Pero bakit dalawa

00:11.694 --> 00:12.400
ang pangalan?

00:12.600 --> 00:13.271
Balikan natin ang

00:13.271 --> 00:14.058
kasaysayan.

00:14.259 --> 00:14.908
Bago pa dumating

00:14.908 --> 00:15.834
ang mga Espanyol,

00:15.834 --> 00:16.655
may mga pamayanan

00:16.655 --> 00:17.107
na tayong

00:17.107 --> 00:17.709
tinatawag na

00:17.709 --> 00:18.310
barangay.

00:18.510 --> 00:19.170
Bawat isa ay

00:19.170 --> 00:19.957
pinamumunuan ng

00:19.957 --> 00:20.407
datu,

00:20.466 --> 00:21.241
at karaniwang may

00:21.241 --> 00:22.063
tatlumpu hanggang

00:22.063 --> 00:23.104
isandaang pamilya.

00:23.303 --> 00:23.824
At ang pangalan

00:23.824 --> 00:24.252
nito?

00:24.452 --> 00:24.811
Galing sa

00:24.811 --> 00:25.332
balangay,

00:25.332 --> 00:25.794
ang bangkang

00:25.794 --> 00:26.582
ginamit ng ating

00:26.582 --> 00:27.380
mga ninuno sa

00:27.380 --> 00:28.144
paglalayag.

00:28.344 --> 00:29.050
Sa Butuan,

00:29.050 --> 00:29.652
may nahukay na

00:29.652 --> 00:30.104
balangay na

00:30.104 --> 00:30.902
tinatayang mula pa

00:30.902 --> 00:32.534
noong taong 320!

00:32.735 --> 00:33.059
At alam mo

00:33.059 --> 00:33.521
rin ba?

00:33.721 --> 00:34.242
Nang dumating ang

00:34.242 --> 00:35.121
mga Espanyol,

00:35.121 --> 00:35.839
pinagsama-sama

00:35.839 --> 00:36.441
nila ang mga

00:36.441 --> 00:37.135
barangay sa mga

00:37.135 --> 00:37.610
bayan,

00:37.610 --> 00:38.269
o pueblo.

00:38.469 --> 00:38.839
At ang mga

00:38.839 --> 00:39.372
barangay,

00:39.372 --> 00:39.939
tinawag nilang

00:39.939 --> 00:40.413
barrio.

00:40.612 --> 00:41.098
Ang barrio ay

00:41.098 --> 00:41.920
salitang Espanyol

00:41.920 --> 00:42.441
na ang ibig

00:42.441 --> 00:43.100
sabihin ay

00:43.100 --> 00:44.037
kapitbahayan.

00:44.237 --> 00:45.024
Sa ating baybay:

00:45.024 --> 00:45.533
baryo.

00:45.733 --> 00:46.392
Kaya sa mahabang

00:46.392 --> 00:46.902
panahon,

00:46.902 --> 00:47.596
baryo ang naging

00:47.596 --> 00:48.626
tawag natin dito.

00:48.827 --> 00:50.343
Kahit noong 1959,

00:50.378 --> 00:51.003
nang ipasa ang

00:51.003 --> 00:51.721
Barrio Charter

00:51.721 --> 00:52.091
Act,

00:52.114 --> 00:52.670
baryo pa rin

00:52.670 --> 00:53.341
ang opisyal na

00:53.341 --> 00:53.873
tawag.

00:54.073 --> 00:54.697
At heto pa!

00:54.897 --> 00:56.262
Noong 1974,

00:56.274 --> 00:56.853
nilagdaan ni

00:56.853 --> 00:57.200
Pangulong

00:57.200 --> 00:58.126
Ferdinand Marcos

00:58.126 --> 00:58.844
ang Presidential

00:58.844 --> 01:00.336
Decree 557.

01:00.536 --> 01:01.057
Lahat ng baryo

01:01.057 --> 01:01.879
sa buong bansa,

01:01.879 --> 01:02.827
ginawang barangay!

01:03.027 --> 01:03.432
Bakit?

01:03.632 --> 01:04.268
Ayon mismo sa

01:04.268 --> 01:04.881
dekreto,

01:04.893 --> 01:05.507
banyaga ang

01:05.507 --> 01:06.062
pinagmulan ng

01:06.062 --> 01:06.918
salitang barrio.

01:07.118 --> 01:07.766
Kaya ibinalik ang

01:07.766 --> 01:08.634
sariling atin:

01:08.634 --> 01:09.235
barangay.

01:09.435 --> 01:09.828
Ngayon,

01:09.840 --> 01:11.252
mahigit 42,000 ang

01:11.252 --> 01:12.051
barangay sa buong

01:12.051 --> 01:12.895
Pilipinas.

01:13.095 --> 01:13.396
Ito ang

01:13.396 --> 01:14.091
pinakamaliit na

01:14.091 --> 01:14.901
yunit ng ating

01:14.901 --> 01:15.676
pamahalaan.

01:15.876 --> 01:16.350
Kaya ano ang

01:16.350 --> 01:17.021
pinagkaiba?

01:17.221 --> 01:17.742
Ang barangay ang

01:17.742 --> 01:18.367
orihinal at

01:18.367 --> 01:18.888
opisyal na

01:18.888 --> 01:19.466
pangalan.

01:19.666 --> 01:20.233
Ang baryo naman

01:20.233 --> 01:20.765
ay galing sa

01:20.765 --> 01:21.402
Espanyol,

01:21.402 --> 01:22.108
at lumang tawag

01:22.108 --> 01:22.790
na lang ngayon.

01:22.990 --> 01:23.696
Pero kapag sinabi

01:23.696 --> 01:24.205
ni lolo na

01:24.205 --> 01:24.992
taga-baryo siya,

01:25.073 --> 01:25.548
tama pa rin

01:25.548 --> 01:25.918
siya!

01:26.117 --> 01:26.417
Ikaw,

01:26.417 --> 01:27.193
baryo o barangay

01:27.193 --> 01:27.679
ang tawag n'yo

01:27.679 --> 01:28.246
sa inyo?

01:28.446 --> 01:29.105
I-comment mo!

01:29.305 --> 01:29.757
At kung gusto

01:29.757 --> 01:30.104
mo pa ng

01:30.104 --> 01:30.474
ganitong

01:30.474 --> 01:31.191
pinagkaiba,

01:31.307 --> 01:31.979
i-follow mo ako

01:31.979 --> 01:32.720
dito sa Juan

01:32.720 --> 01:33.529
Fact a Day!
